{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12042","headline":"寓言二首 二 · 贾至","name":"寓言二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凛凛秋闺夕，绮罗早知寒。\n玉砧调鸣杵，始捣机中纨。\n忆昨别离日，桐花覆井栏。\n今来思君时，白露盈堦漙。\n闻有关河信，欲寄双玉盘。\n玉以委贞心，盘以荐嘉餐。\n嗟君在万里，使妾衣带宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}